<div class="page-title"><h1>About</h1></div>
<div class="prose">

<img src="{{ '/img/microplotter-desktop-setup.jpg' | url }}" alt="A complete Microplotter desktop setup" style="border-radius:12px">

<p>SonoPlot designs and builds Microplotter&reg; materials-dispensing systems used for micro-scale material printing &mdash; drawing features as small as 10&ndash;20 microns using our patented ultrasonic dispensing technology.</p>

<p>Customers use the Microplotter to print conductive traces (nanometallic silver, carbon nanotubes, graphene) for printed electronics, and to deposit DNA, proteins, and other biological materials for life-science research &mdash; including microarrays, ELISA-type assays, and mass spectrometry sample prep.</p>

<h2>Who we work with</h2>

<p>Our customers include NASA, Microsoft, MIT, Becton Dickinson, and dozens of research universities worldwide.</p>

